dlprevent-guard

This product is a fork of AnveGuard (prompt-sentinel-flow)
  https://github.com/ANVE-AI/prompt-sentinel-flow
by ANVE-AI, licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.
Only AnveGuard's policy engine is included: the files in
supabase/functions/_shared/. Its dashboard, edge functions and other files
are omitted.

Changes in this fork (2026), also licensed under the Apache License,
Version 2.0, by the DLPrevent project (info@dlprevent.ch):

  - guard/server.ts, guard/agent_rules.ts, guard/server_test.ts,
    guard/deno.json, guard/Dockerfile, guard/compose.yml, guard/.gitignore:
    a self-contained proxy that runs AnveGuard's policy engine between an
    AI agent and its model provider, rules for agent commands, and its
    container.
  - supabase/functions/_shared/policy_engine.ts: detectPII is bounded by
    MAX_REGEX_INPUT_LEN and its email pattern no longer backtracks
    quadratically; the <IMPORTANT>-tag and markdown-image checks run in
    linear time. Each change is marked "dlprevent-guard:" in the file.
  - supabase/functions/_shared/threat_intel.json: the EchoLeak signature's
    repeats are bounded, so it no longer backtracks quadratically.
  - README.md: replaced.
  - docs/images/dlprevent-logo.svg: the DLPrevent logo.

"AnveGuard" is a name of ANVE-AI. This fork is not affiliated with or
endorsed by ANVE-AI.
